WEBVTT

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.910
What's wrong?

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:23.290
Oh, it's you Amagi. Good timing.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:26.790
Akagi and Kaga are fighting again.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:31.700
Oh, dear. When will they grow up?

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:08.330
I'm dying! I'm going to die!

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:16.120
Come on! How am I supposed to enjoy this?

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:25.540
What?!

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:29.950
Siren!

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:32.410
Oh, hey, Enterprise!

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:39.500
Yes...!

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:47.830
Okay, now it's fun!

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:50.500
But too bad, gotta go!

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.540
I'll be waiting for you on the final stage!

00:02:57.330 --> 00:02:58.830
She's hitting her own ships, too...?

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.080
She got away.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.660
You are always here for us
when we are in danger.

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:35.160
You take far too many risks for someone
who lectured against that.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:39.290
I feel as though I am protected
by a knight in shining armor.

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:41.410
Spare me. That's not my style.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.500
We've outrun the Sakura Empire fleet.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:08.200
That said, they seemed too confused
to put up much of a fight.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:09.540
We're close.

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:14.040
I have to say,
it's quite a grandiose scheme.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:18.540
Battles need to be dramatic.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:22.200
They are the physical
manifestations of will.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.540
It is will that drives them
and gives them strength.

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:28.950
The things you say are
too sentimental and hard to understand.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.910
She's just full of herself, that's all.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:35.540
Looks like someone took a beating.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.950
I'm not against a bit of rough play.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:50.370
Let's begin. An encore of the past,
or perhaps a calculation of the future.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:05.700
Tick-tock, tick-tock. Rise and shine!

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:32.750
Dear sister...?

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:42.410
Akagi... Dear sister Akagi!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:46.790
You're alive!

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:50.250
Yes. This is what the gods intend.

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:54.290
Look, Kaga...

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:58.080
This is the power of <i>Orochi</i> --
the power we desire.

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.660
What is this...?

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:42.620
It has to be a Siren attack, obviously.

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:45.700
But why did they hit a remote,
uninhabited island?

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:50.200
To taunt us, perhaps? They underestimate us.

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:53.160
But, Your Majesty, this situation is dire.

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:55.370
If they use this to strike this base...

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:58.700
Kaboom! We won't stand a chance.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:01.160
I'm not sure if this is related in any way,

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:03.370
but a few hours before the island vaporized,

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:07.500
a huge, unknown vessel
departed from Sakura Empire.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:10.290
Sheffy, this ship...

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:15.370
Yes, it matches the characteristics of
the ship we saw beneath Sakura Empire.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:22.080
This is <i>Orochi</i> ... What an enormous ship...

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:26.000
The Sakura Empire port was
heavily damaged by <i>Orochi</i> .

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:30.660
This must be an unanticipated event,
even for the Red Axis.

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:37.120
Perhaps the Red Axis were just
being played by the Sirens, like us...

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:40.000
No.

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:48.370
We haven't done anything yet.

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:50.200
We haven't accomplished anything.

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:54.500
Enterprise...

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:59.700
This starts now. We're going to crush
whatever it is the Sirens are plotting.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:06.200
This is not an issue for just us Azur Lane.

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:10.120
The <i>Orochi</i> is a threat to all of humanity.

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:13.080
I've already pulled some strings.

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:15.580
We always cleanse off
any humiliation we receive.

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:17.870
That is the Royal Navy way.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:21.330
And the Eagle Union way is payback!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:25.750
We must fight... one more time.

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:40.950
Didn't see that coming, did you, Eugen?

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:45.200
Indeed, I did not. Who would have expected
Kaga to choose such a violent approach?

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:49.080
Are the Sirens behind this, too?

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:52.500
Akagi and Kaga are really with the Sirens...?

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:56.790
It's pretty silly how Sakura Empire
didn't realize they had a spy inside.

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:58.620
Is it really only the Sakura Empire?

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:00.040
Huh?

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.870
Perhaps, in Iron Blood as well...

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:08.500
Or rather, there could be Siren influence
in the higher echelons of all camps...

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:10.580
What are you thinking?

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:16.290
Never mind. There's no value
in dwelling on that, at least for now.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:21.250
What have you done, Kaga... ?

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:23.700
There is no excuse for this.

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:28.500
I was underestimating her...

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.910
I didn't think she would go this far.

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:33.330
What's going to happen to Kaga?

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:41.330
If she is in league with the Sirens, that is
a serious betrayal of the Sakura Empire.

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:45.410
Worst case, we may need to
strike her down, along with the <i>Orochi</i> .

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:47.580
N-No...

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:49.250
That's not right...

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.250
Yukikaze...

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:55.000
Ayanami, captured. Akagi, missing.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:58.790
Ever since the start of this battle,
only bad things have happened...

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:06.660
Come on! We don't know for sure yet
that they betrayed us!

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.330
I understand your feelings, but...

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:13.540
This is wrong.

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:18.250
We haven't been fighting all this time
to take down a friend.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:20.000
Zuikaku.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:26.830
We're bringing Kaga back. If she won't listen,
we'll slap her and wake her up.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:31.250
That's right. We're not playing along
with the Siren scheme!

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:33.950
--Z-Zuikaku!
--Whoa...

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:45.620
You're all grown up now. It's a bit sad
to see you leave your big sister's hands.

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:54.250
Dear sister. What have you...?

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.290
Oh, Kaga.

00:10:57.540 --> 00:10:59.910
Don't be so afraid.

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:03.450
It's fine. I'm not going anywhere.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:07.580
No.

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:09.080
Kaga?

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.290
Who is that...

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.870
...inside my dear sister?!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:24.080
You can be so difficult.

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:41.660
Amagi...?

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:44.660
Long time no see, Kaga.

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:49.250
No... That's not right either.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:50.750
Who are you?

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:55.500
I am Amagi. Because that is what Akagi desires.

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:59.000
Are you... Orochi?

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.330
Let go of my dear sister!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.830
Are you sure?

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:11.540
After all that Akagi
went through to see me?

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:13.290
Enough treachery, fake!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.410
But you're a fake as well.

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:19.790
Please take care of Akagi as well.

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:24.660
Amagi died, leaving Akagi behind.

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:29.120
Parts of Amagi were passed on to another ship.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:30.160
Stop.

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:35.120
You know this, Kaga.

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:37.660
Stop...

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:40.200
Aircraft Carrier Kaga...

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:44.200
You are a ship that was
retrofitted using Amagi's parts.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:50.750
Akagi loved you because she saw
a shadow of Amagi inside you.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:53.200
But that is an illusion.

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:55.620
Dear sister... I...

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:58.370
You're not even a replacement.

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:01.160
You're a collection of decayed parts.

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:04.200
A Ship of Theseus that shall not sail...

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:07.080
That's what you are, Kaga.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:37.160
Are you sure about this?

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:42.620
It seems like you hold some
special meaning to the Sirens as well.

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:45.120
There may yet be another unimaginable trap...

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:47.540
Still, I must fight on.

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:52.200
To get to the truth, I can't turn away
from the battle at hand.

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:56.950
Once again, I will face off against this ocean.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.580
It was foolish of me to ask.

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:05.080
My duty is to see your convictions through.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:06.700
I will be at your side.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.040
It's fine.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.620
It's fine. We can do it.

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:24.660
U- <i>chan</i> will protect us, too.

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:37.250
What's this? What's up?

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:38.700
Red Axis, maybe?

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:44.660
Looks like they've started the fight
against the Sirens without us.

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:48.410
Right... Let's do this!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.540
Leave it to me, the famous Yukikaze!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:10.450
I'll bite you!

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.290
Don't go too far ahead!

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:18.580
What is this? What is this?!

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:28.040
Oh, what a cute guest. Let's run
some tests and see what data I can get.

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:29.580
Upper-class Siren!

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:45.790
So many powerful-looking Sirens!

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:52.250
Troublesome... We can't even
get close to the <i>Orochi</i> .

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:55.700
We have to do it, Shoukaku.
If the path before us is blocked...

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.250
...we have to cut through with force!

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.250
Kaga...!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:23.450
What... am I...

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:28.910
Don't worry, Akagi.
Your wish has already come true.

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:32.040
Eternal love is right here with you.

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:34.370
My wish...

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:36.450
My love...

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:41.790
Dear sister Amagi, I... Sakura Empire...

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:48.250
You stubborn fool! Is your head
completely blank like the color of your hair?!

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:53.540
Silence, you Amagi lackey! I can settle this
right here, if you're ready for that!

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.250
Dear sister Amagi--

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.910
I told you all to get along with each other.

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:07.450
Fighting is no way to get along.

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:12.160
Come on, shake hands and be friends.

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:17.660
Be. Friends.

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.000
You will not harm <i>Orochi</i> .

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.620
Kaga...!

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:35.040
Why are you working with the Siren?!
This is wrong!

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:38.580
My only wish is to make dear sister
Akagi's wishes come true!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:43.250
Come on! Where is your usual cool face?!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.000
Yuudachi!

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:56.540
Hey! Are you okay?!

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:59.660
Oh, yeah, I'm good...

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:01.830
This isn't good.

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:11.660
Hey! Stay sharp!

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:15.660
Please get up.

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.750
Concentrate or they'll get you.

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:20.290
Double down!

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:24.200
So glad to have so many guests.

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.620
What now?

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:30.700
Even with our joint force,
we're still quite outnumbered.

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:35.500
Oh, my sister, did you lose
your optimism along with your breasts?

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:37.040
I'm going to slap you around!

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:41.200
I'm just joking. But you're right.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:44.040
Right now would be a great time
to draw a new card.

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:55.160
Here they come.

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:56.410
Reinforcements?

00:18:56.410 --> 00:19:00.790
Who knows? Is the enemy
of my enemy my friend?

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:02.330
I certainly hope so.

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:12.870
Welcome, Azur Lane. We've been waiting.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.540
Glory to the Queen!

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:34.870
Enterprise.

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:38.830
Warriors, go forth!

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:50.290
We can't let Royal Navy
take all the fun! Let's go, guys!

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:09.660
Wake up, Kaga! The Sirens are just using you!

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:10.950
Nothing matters.

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:24.500
I won't let you hurt Zuikaku.

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:25.540
Sis!

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:30.620
Oh... Nothing matters at all to me.

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:38.080
You're from Azur Lane...

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.500
Things do matter.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:47.120
Ayanami, it's you.

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:51.370
Are you trying to get in the way
of my dear sister and I?

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:56.950
No. I'm here to save everyone.

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:10.500
Enterprise! Look...!

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.000
Is that...

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.450
Is that Akagi?!

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:25.120
And that other one...

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:35.620
What are they doing?!

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:46.870
It goes without saying.

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.200
Doesn't it, Akagi?

00:22:06.370 --> 00:22:08.120
Good, now you're...

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:10.450
Everything is...

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:15.080
You hold the future of
Sakura Empire in your hands.

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:17.250
Everyone has to be...

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:19.000
...or else we can't beat the...

00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:22.370
Yes...

00:22:22.370 --> 00:22:25.410
Let's begin a real war.

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.620
<i>When the starshine wanes in them</i>

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:57.200
<i>Until the morning comes</i>
<i>when we can hold hands</i>
